      "content": "thanks for those. the \"just-offense\" one is interesting but a bit vague for my students. can you flesh that out? i want them to be able to make a really high-level philosophical argument about why the rule of law and the integrity of the legal system necessitate strict enforcement, even if it seems harsh to some. can you provide a more detailed, sophisticated version of that specific point?",
